  DEFINE VARIABLE V-{&ROWID_TABLA} AS ROWID.
  RUN {&SELECCION} ( OUTPUT V-{&ROWID_TABLA} ).
  IF V-{&ROWID_TABLA} <> ? 
  THEN DO:
       FIND {&TABLA} WHERE ROWID({&TABLA}) = V-{&ROWID_TABLA} NO-LOCK.
       DISPLAY {&TABLA}.{&CDG_TABLA} @ {&VARIABLE}
               WITH FRAME F-Main.
       &IF {&MOSTRAR_DSC} 
       &THEN
       {&V-DSC_TABLA} = {&TABLA}.{&DSC_TABLA}.
       DISPLAY {&V-DSC_TABLA}
               WITH FRAME F-Main.
       &ENDIF        
       RETURN NO-APPLY.
  END.                        